nodes.body:
@Qiaolin-Yu Could you please review this GLM-5.3-Flash PP + MTP multimodal embedding fix and help enable CI?

All applicable pre-commit checks pass. Seven CPU regression tests pass with the fix, with four failing against the unmodified source. Manual TP8/PP2 testing also confirms that the fix resolves the warmup assertion and produces correct image responses, including chunked prefill.

Distributed PP4 validation and communication-overhead measurements remain pending. Thank you!

